  "name": "Demo 7 - 工具呼叫 [AI Agent + Tools + Gemini]",
  "description": null,
  "active": false,
  "isArchived": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "80f10867-ef1e-48cc-b06a-3d4ae47dd4af",
      "name": "說明",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        60,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "content": "## Demo 7 — Tool Calling（工具呼叫）\n\n**目的**：展示 AI Agent 自主決定呼叫哪個工具\n\n**核心元件**\n- AI Agent（工具代理）\n- Google Gemini Chat Model（決策引擎）\n- Tool 1：查設備狀態（HTTP Request → mock API）\n- Tool 2：查告警歷史（HTTP Request → mock API）\n\n**Demo 步驟**\n1. 點 Execute workflow\n2. AI 分析問題，自主決定呼叫 Tool 1 或 Tool 2\n3. 看 Agent 的 tool call 過程\n\n**關鍵差異**\n- 傳統做法：IF 節點硬寫判斷邏輯\n- AI Agent：模型自己判斷要呼叫哪個工具、傳什麼參數"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6f0ca993-691e-4e1e-8fe7-ab48cc9a1bfd",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "30782317-64d3-49ec-9404-4105b93cb9de",
      "name": "設定：使用者問題",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        460,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "f669a547-58e2-483f-8b93-8ae69d5fd0a5",
              "name": "question",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "prod-node-03 目前的 CPU 狀態怎麼樣？有沒有相關的 Critical 告警？"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1ce07f3f-0cfc-40bd-9c2c-6714333273cb",
      "name": "AI Agent：工具決策",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        680,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "agent": "toolsAgent",
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.question }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "你是 TSMC IT 維運助理。你有兩個工具可以使用：\n1. 查設備狀態：輸入設備名稱，查詢當前 CPU/Memory/Network 狀態\n2. 查告警歷史：輸入設備名稱或告警等級，查詢最近的告警記錄\n\n根據使用者的問題，判斷需要呼叫哪些工具（可以呼叫多次），最後整合結果用繁體中文回答。"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e2ac0a96-44ee-4e8e-a68e-21b3a352febd",
      "name": "Google Gemini Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        560,
        520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "models/gemini-2.5-flash",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "G7B3Jkm3AiKjF1gY",
          "name": "Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "31e171c1-d7f9-42a6-9b0f-6fdc9f716068",
      "name": "Tool：查設備狀態",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        760,
        520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "=http://host.containers.internal:3001/api/devices/{{ $fromAI('device_name', '設備名稱，例如 prod-node-03') }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "description": "查詢指定設備的 CPU、Memory、Network 即時狀態"
    },
    {
      "id": "7b50f595-f7af-4821-96c9-e148d5af11f2",
      "name": "Tool：查告警歷史",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
